<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= title %> · <%= locals.nomeProduto || 'Captura Total' %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css?v=2.1" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/site.css?v=2.1" />
  <style>body.ent { margin: 0; }</style>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/static/img/logo-32.png" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/static/img/logo-192.png" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/static/img/logo-180.png" />
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="<%= locals.nomeProduto || 'Captura Total' %>" />
</head>
<body class="ent">
  <aside class="ent-painel" aria-hidden="true">
    <a href="/" class="lp-marca" tabindex="-1"><img src="/static/img/logo-64.png" srcset="/static/img/logo-64.png 1x, /static/img/logo-128.png 2x" alt="" class="selo-logo" width="32" height="32" /><%= locals.nomeProduto || 'Captura Total' %></a>
    <div>
      <blockquote>Toda manhã, as notas dos seus clientes já estão aqui.</blockquote>
      <p>XML, PDF e prazos de manifestação de cada CNPJ da carteira, sem baixar nada à mão.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ent-chave">
      <div>3526 1012 3456 7800 0190 5500 1000 0045 1210 0004 5127</div>
      <div><b>3526 1098 7654 3200 0155 5700 1000 0881 0410 0088 1046</b></div>
      <div>3526 1045 6789 0100 0123 6500 2000 0197 7610 0019 7768</div>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <main class="ent-lado">
    <div class="ent-caixa">
      <a href="/" class="lp-marca"><img src="/static/img/logo-64.png" srcset="/static/img/logo-64.png 1x, /static/img/logo-128.png 2x" alt="" class="selo-logo" width="32" height="32" /><%= locals.nomeProduto || 'Captura Total' %></a>
      <% if (typeof flash !== 'undefined' && flash) { %>
        <div class="ent-aviso <%= flash.type === 'erro' ? 'erro' : flash.type === 'ok' ? 'ok' : 'info' %>" role="<%= flash.type === 'erro' ? 'alert' : 'status' %>" style="margin-bottom:18px"><%= flash.msg %></div>
      <% } %>
      <%- body %>
    </div>
  </main>
  <script>
    if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
      window.addEventListener('load', function () {
        navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js').catch(function (err) {
          console.warn('[PWA] Falha ao registrar Service Worker:', err);
        });
      });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
